routine release_voidwork2[A, B](raw: Addr, kept: U8) -> None
needs A: typename, B: typename
    work: @VoidWork2[A, B] = raw.to[@VoidWork2[A, B]]()
    if kept & 1 != 0
        drop work.first
    if kept & 2 != 0
        drop work.second
    return

### Gives back the accesses a `VoidWork3` block was handed, the arguments `kept` marks (bit 0 the first): what
### `retrieve()` of a work started with `start_from` does once the work is over.
### :param raw: The block.
### :param kept: One bit for each argument that is an access.
routine release_voidwork3[A, B, C](raw: Addr, kept: U8) -> None
needs A: typename, B: typename, C: typename
